      "content": "thanks, that's a relief to hear. i was reading something online about blood clots and it sounded pretty scary, so i'm glad it's probably just the flight. you mentioned a high dose of aspirin... just how much would you say is a \"good\" amount to help with the circulation? i have some 325mg ones here, should i take two or three at once to make sure it actually works? also, the calf is starting to feel a bit warm to the touch, is that just from the inflammation you mentioned?",
